  <data key="d8">Wildfire Prepared Home is a designation program that reduces wildfire risks to homes through a system of mitigation actions at the parcel level, based on the latest science and research from the nonprofit Insurance Institute for Business &amp; Home Safety (IBHS).</data>
  <data key="d11">False</data>
  <data key="d12">LOW</data>
