  <data key="d8">o If the Annual Review is paid for after the 60-day “Active” Grace Period following the Anniversary Date, the property will remain Inactive until the application is approved by IBHS. Inactive applications will be 2025 Wildfire Prepared Home™ Technical Standard 4 automatically closed 60 days before either the second Annual Review or the Expiration Date listed on the most recent designation certific</data>
