  <data key="d0">regulation</data>
  <data key="d7">IBHS_WFPH</data>
  <data key="d8">At the end of the 3-year designation period, a property’s Wildfire Prepared Home designation will expire. To maintain an Active designation status, homeowners must complete the full designation process to verify continued compliance with the most current Technical Standard.</data>
  <data key="d11">False</data>
  <data key="d12">LOW</data>
  <data key="d10">clearance</data>
  <data key="d13">ALL</data>
</node>
