  <data key="d7">IBHS_WFPH</data>
  <data key="d8">• Note: Given the potential service life uncertainties of both ignition-resistant treatments and applied ignition-resistant coatings, the use of wood shake, wood shingle, or any wood roof covering material regardless of test rating are not permitted. 2.1.2 Gutters and Downspouts</data>
  <data key="d11">False</data>
  <data key="d12">LOW</data>
  <data key="d10">material</data>
  <data key="d13">ALL</data>
