  <data key="d0">regulation</data>
  <data key="d7">IBHS_WFPH</data>
  <data key="d8">• Setback – A detached combustible overhead structure (e.g., pergola and gazebo) on an attached deck shall be at least 10 feet from all exterior walls of the home. (see 2.2.3 Detached Accessory Dwelling Units and Accessory Structures for additional requirements).</data>
  <data key="d11">True</data>
  <data key="d12">LOW</data>
