  <data key="d8">o Shall place wood piles at least 30 feet away from the home unless the wood is stored in an accessory structure (see 2.2.3 Accessory Dwelling Units and Accessory Structures for Base Level requirements or 3.2.2 for Plus Level requirements). Fire-retardant tarps are not permitted. 2.2.2.2 Other items</data>
  <data key="d11">True</data>
