  <data key="d0">regulation</data>
  <data key="d7">IBHS_WFPH</data>
  <data key="d8">• Exterior doors shall be approved noncombustible construction, or solid-core wood not less than 1-¾ inches thick (44 mm). The exterior doors shall be constructed with noncombustible threshold. Windows within doors and glazed doors shall be in accordance with this standard’s exterior glass requirements (see 3.1.5 Exterior Glass).</data>
  <data key="d11">True</data>
  <data key="d12">LOW</data>
  <data key="d10">material</data>
  <data key="d13">ALL</data>
</node>
