  <data key="d0">regulation</data>
  <data key="d7">IBHS_WFPH</data>
  <data key="d8">o Stairs shall have closed risers. Stair treads and risers shall be a solid, and made of noncombustible material (e.g., metal or light-weight concrete) with no gaps. 3.2 Defensible Space Requirements for the Plus Level 3.2.1 Parallel Fences within 5 to 30 feet</data>
  <data key="d11">False</data>
  <data key="d12">CRITICAL</data>
  <data key="d10">material</data>
  <data key="d13">Zone_0</data>
